; `any` as an array element (`[any]`; equally `{ k: any }` map values) is a SUPPORTED position: it
; lowers to the `AnyCbor` static-runtime type, which has both a rust and a wasm wrapper, so this row
; is `ok` under the default (--wasm=true) profile — NOT a panic (it formerly panicked at the
; `generic_instances` assert, before `any` had an IR representation).
; The position's support is proven by the snapshot/e2e fixtures.
a = [any]
